title: Pictures as cards: png of several shapes, an svg, one that is not a picture and an empty one; the menu on a picture
folders: media

wait 3500
left files
fit
wait 1500
mark whole
wait 500
goto img/checks.png
wait 1500
mark checks
wait 500
menu 1000 450
wait 600
mark checks-menu
wait 500
ui click 500 800
wait 300
goto img/wide.png
wait 1300
mark wide
wait 500
goto img/tall.png
wait 1300
mark tall
wait 500
goto img/tiny.png
wait 1300
mark tiny
wait 500
goto img/broken.png
wait 1300
mark broken
wait 500
goto img/empty.png
wait 1300
mark empty
wait 500
goto img/drawing.svg
wait 1300
mark svg
wait 500
ignored ignored/hidden.png
wait 1500
mark ignored-picture
wait 500
goto img
wait 1300
zoom 0.05
wait 800
mark far-away
wait 500
quit
